{"title":"1988 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The reciprocal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/9/159d73086694a14bfc3f091eba425986c6896d91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( \\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"71\" height=\"43\" /> is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/9/079a9d1e5930d8ae22dec11b75e69bfd657eadf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{6} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\frac{2}{5} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\frac{6}{5} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{5}{2} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"346\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/f/ebf88aeea1b5c5d2f3f82022620757d9ddf323a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{5}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />, and the reciprocal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/3/5533bc48602603f16d18c04858cad119c04833c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/6/50692378111e5a171bbc18e755b8e30267db9555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 